&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own communications for our AI infrastructure stack at group level, working at the cutting edge of one of the most dynamic industries in tech — and helping us build that future the responsible way, driven by a strong green agenda at the heart of how we grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a senior communications leader with strong agency experience and deep&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;across technology, data centers, AI, infrastructure, data centers and / or cloud, you will define, shape, and amplify&amp;nbsp;our global&amp;nbsp;narrative. You bring a strong understanding of the&amp;nbsp;hyperscaler&amp;nbsp;landscape and broader ecosystem (including Nvidia), enabling you to engage credibly with our most important audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will ensure that the global AI infrastructure story resonates with global&amp;nbsp;stakeholders, including&amp;nbsp;hyperscalers, media, analysts, and policymakers. Your work will localize global&amp;nbsp;messaging&amp;nbsp;to the&amp;nbsp;EMEA, APAC and&amp;nbsp;US market, proactively build reputation, and&amp;nbsp;establish&amp;nbsp;a trusted voice for the company in a complex and highly competitive environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
