&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Manager, Solutions Architecture - India at GitLab, you&#39;ll manage a distributed team of Solutions Architects working with customers across the India region. In this&amp;nbsp;player-coach role, you&#39;ll guide technical strategy across complex sales motions while also stepping directly into high-impact opportunities to help your team secure technical wins and build customer confidence in GitLab&#39;s platform approach. At GitLab, we work at the intersection of technical sales strategy, team development, and operational scale, and you&#39;ll help translate customer requirements into clear business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
